Statically linked with logging disabled by the application environment hooks.
Its pinned build dependencies include msgpack-c (Boost Software License 1.0,
5ee9a1c8c325658b29867829677c7eb79c433a98), libdeflate (MIT,
b03254d978d7af21a7512dee8fdc3367bc15c656), Tracy headers (BSD-3-Clause),
and LMDB (OpenLDAP Public License 2.8). Upstream CMake files pin these sources.
The BN254 CRS is the public Aztec Ignition ceremony transcript prefix, not a
secret setup key. Runtime never downloads it; exact hashes are in assets.json.
